name: ['Acquire', 'Arrest', 'Breath of Malfegor', 'Consume Spirit', 'Corrupt', 'Duress', 'Electrolyze', 'Faithless Looting', 'Feast of Blood', 'Gaze of Granite', 'High Tide', 'Ogre Arsonist', 'Standstill', 'Treasure Hunt', 'Turnabout', 'Voidmage Husher', 'Wash Out']
