rarity: ['Rare']
text: ['Breath of Malfegor deals 5 damage to each opponent.', 'Cast this spell only if you control two or more Vampires.\\nDestroy target creature. You gain 4 life.', 'Choose artifact, creature, or land. Tap all untapped permanents of the chosen type target player controls, or untap all tapped permanents of that type that player controls.', 'Corrupt deals damage to any target equal to the number of Swamps you control. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Destroy each nonland permanent with mana value X or less.', 'Draw two cards, then discard two cards.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Electrolyze deals 2 damage divided as you choose among one or two targets.\\nDraw a card.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.", "Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nWhen Voidmage Husher enters the battlefield, counter target activated ability. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)\\nWhenever you cast a spell, you may return Voidmage Husher to its owner's hand.", "Return all permanents of the color of your choice to their owners' hands.", 'Reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a nonland card, then put all cards revealed this way into your hand.', "Search target opponent's library for an artifact card and put that card onto the battlefield under your control. Then that player shuffles.", 'Spend only black mana on X.\\nConsume Spirit deals X damage to any target and you gain X life.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Until end of turn, whenever a player taps an Island for mana, that player adds an additional {U}.', 'When Ogre Arsonist enters the battlefield, destroy target land.', "When a player casts a spell, sacrifice Standstill. If you do, each of that player's opponents draws three cards."]
flavor: ['"\'Ownership\' is such a gray area."', '"All of Ravnica\'s looking for you, Dack, from the Wojek on down."\\n—Maytov', '"Perhaps planning should become a higher priority for me."\\n—Dack Fayden', '"Show yourself, thief."', '"Some call me a thief. I prefer to think of myself as a discreet borrower."\\n—Dack Fayden, Planeswalker', '"There\'s nothing like the high seas to clear your head or escape pursuers."', '"You learn a lot in no time when you\'re about to get your neck snapped."\\n—Dack Fayden', '"Your nightmares inspire me, Dack."', '"Youth is wasted on the young. So I help myself to some of it from time to time."\\n—Sifa Grent', "Fayden didn't know if the giant had created the spehere's magic—only that he had to escape it to find Sifa.", 'Imbued in the Ancient Fang were spells far darker than any Dack Fayden would cast.', "The draconic demon loomed over Dack, and he suddenly sensed he wasn't the only Planeswalker that Malfegor had encountered."]
artist: ['Aleksi Briclot', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Volkan Baǵa']
